<title>PORTUGAL: Bank of Portugal injects 50 bln esc, 5.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Portugal injects 50 bln esc, 5.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it injected 50 billion escudos of seven-day funds into the money market at a weighted average rate of 5.7 percent in a fixed rate repurchase tender.</p>
<p>The Bank had earlier announced that the rate was being cut from 6.0 percent.</p>
<p>-- LISBON BUREAU 3511-3538254</p>
</text>
